<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Hello </span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! </font><span style="font-family: arial;">We do have a </span><b style="font-family: arial;">(name of degree here)</b><span style="font-family: arial;"> that is 100 percent online and offered through ASU Online.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">For more information on this program, I recommend contacting a representative from ASU Online at 1-866-277-6589 or <a href="http://asuonline.asu.edu/">via chat</a>. The representative will be able to provide you with the best information on the process of transferring into one of our online programs, as well as on tuition and other important information about registering for classes.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Sincerely,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
